  "definition": "A tradable asset class representing physical goods such as metals (gold, oil), energy, and agricultural products (coffee, corn). Known for good volatility, inflation protection, and use as a hedge, but market movements are complex due to many external factors.",
  "definition_per_source": {
    "SMC-Strong-Weak-Supplement": "A tradable asset class representing physical goods such as metals (gold, oil), energy, and agricultural products (coffee, corn). Known for good volatility, inflation protection, and use as a hedge, but market movements are complex due to many external factors."
